" of specified player. these shops can be purchasedby a fee, and then the owner can put items for sale in it.when an item is put for sale, a price must be given. when anotherplayer comes to buy the eq, he gets it for the spesified cost.other players can also propose a trade where they would sell an itemfor a price to the shop owner. the item is held by the shop aslong as the proposal is on. the shop owner can purchase the itemproposed. the proposed item can be withdrawn any time.",0,}),19:({"(done)give all, sell all bugs","","Completed by 0",}),20:({"(done)ress cost","","Completed by Neophyte",}),21:({"(done)floating disc fix","","Completed by Astarel",}),22:({"(done)cast satisfy","","Completed by Neophyte",}),23:({"(done)floating disc fix","","Completed by Astarel",}),24:({"(done)voting board","","Completed by Astarel",}),25:({"(done)necromancers","","Completed by Astarel",}),26:({"(done)fix reflect spell","","Completed by Neophyte",}),27:({"(done)recode strike&tremendous blow","","Completed by Neophyte",}),28:({"(done)fix torches&lanterns","","Completed by Celtron",}),29:({"bansystem improve","Added on [Thu Mar 21 16:41:18 2002] (by Celtron)Subject: bansystem improveadd an additional query for archs that ban ppl so that a reason is askedALSO in stringmode (the arch types in something descriptive).the reason 1-4 is showed to the banned player, but the typed reason isshown to the archs. also is possible to do the bandaemon to post a newsarticlefor each banevent (if you want to do this).",0,}),30:({"(done)say last","","Completed by Nalle",}),31:({"(done)partysystem recode","","Completed by Celtron",}),32:({"(done)recode ignore command","","Completed by Nalle",}),33:({"(done)eating corpses","","Completed by Nalle",}),34:({"(done)mudboard","","Completed by Nalle",}),35:({"(done)recall horde","","Completed by Neophyte",}),36:({"(done)skill first strike","","Completed by Celtron",}),37:({"(done)fix_horde_bug","","Completed by Neophyte",}),38:({"(done)fix 