,"Completed by Jenny",}),54:({"(done)a 'call' command","","Completed by Nalle",}),55:({"(done)Hunger/thirst into score","","Completed by 0",}),56:({"(done)trashcans","","Completed by Jenny",}),57:({"(done)grep","","Completed by Kuaffel",}),58:({"(done)bug command rewrite","","Completed by 0",}),59:({"autoban for too many connections","Added on [Wed Jan 21 15:28:28 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: autoban for too many connectionsif 5 connection attempts are made from the same ip duringa time of 60 seconds, autoban that ip for 30mins.",0,}),60:({"leadership-skill","Added on [Thu Jan 22 17:57:46 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: leadership-skillleadership-skill to one of fighter subguilds.the skill affects in party with more than one members andwhen the character with the skill is the acting leaderof the party.100% skill increases total party exp share rate from 120% to 130%.the rate is now 125% by default, so this would be changed.also the leader with the skill would get more levels whenthe party share of exp is calculated. with full skill (100%)",0,}),61:({"leader-ship skill (continues)","Added on [Thu Jan 22 17:59:48 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: leader-ship skill (continues)...a level 100 fighter would be considered as a level 100+0.20*100=120character. This of course means that the other party members' sharegets a bit lower, but due the raise of total party experience thiscan be considered insignificent for 2 players of the same level.",0,}),62:({"money cost for reinc","Added on [Mon Mar  1 20:24:06 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: money cost for reinccode an automatic little money cost for player to player reinc&ress.money should be xferred between players' bank accounts.amount is like 20-200 bronzes (dependant of xp/level/whatever)if target has no money, then no money is xferred, but spell still succeeds.",0,}),63:({"check help files","Added on [Thu Mar  4 19:52:54 2004] (by Walla)Subject: check help filesto check help files, remove the ones that are redundent, and update the onesthat need to be updated.","Walla",}),64:({"new EQ system","Added on [Wed May 19 16:32:20 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: new EQ systemThe eq system is now file-dependant, so that every eq has a physicalfile that inherits the weapon or armour corefile. This would be changedso that the eq save string in locker/playerfile/castles would containall the info about the item, so that the item wouldn't be loadedfrom a specific file, but instead the corefile would be clonedand then adjusted by the arguments given in the savestring.TO DO: savestring creation and extraction functions forfiles that inherit weapon.c and armour.c .",0,}),65:({"gods and religion","Added on [Wed May 19 16:37:52 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: gods and religionimplement a plan that contains atleast three different gods thatfavor different alignments/deeds/guilds/races/whateverthe plan must also contain the info about how to reach the favorof the gods and the effects of the benefits gained by doing so.NOTE! simple corpse sacrifice is not enough.(are rotting corpses valuable? hardly.)after the plan has been approved by me, you need to code it",0,}),66:({"Boat around Deleria","Added on [Sun May 23 12:52:18 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: Boat around DeleriaCode a boat that goes round the island. Stops can be in Duranghom (river), Asgroth,and so. Some stops could be even in the middle of plains.The boat trip would cost some money for players and take some time (not much).Naturally one needs to code the piers too where the boat lands.There could be even two boats circling around the island, using thesame route.",0,}),67:({"direct damage policy","Added on [Thu Jun  3 18:28:56 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: direct damage policydisable all hit_with_spell calls that come from items,eq,...reroute the calls via skills or spells that are in-game.hit_player func is called from core combat alone.",0,}),68:({"stat boost policy","Added on [Thu Jun  3 18:30:52 2004] (by Celtron)Subject: stat boost policystats in player should be static, calculated from guildbonuses asentering the game. all statboost shadows are to be removed andreplaced with static mapping in player.c",0,}),])
task_name "stat boost policy"
